# Skin Theory - environment variables
#
# Copy this file to a file named .env in the same folder, then fill in the box
# below. Never commit .env. It is already listed in .gitignore.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WEB3FORMS ACCESS KEY
#
# What it does: sends the contact form, the newsletter signup, and every
#               checkout order to the shop inbox.
# How to get it: go to https://web3forms.com, type the email address that
#               should receive the messages, and the key arrives in that inbox.
#               It is free and takes about a minute.
# If you leave it empty: the site still works. The forms will not send, and
#               they will show a calm message with the shop email and phone
#               number instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
